+# VoidedClient 1.8.2
+
+- Added the full Daily Expedition GUI, opened from the Exploration Journal or `/exploration contract` on VoidedCore 6.50.0.
+- Added contract objective, live progress, completion state, rewards, rarity requirement and UTC contract date.
+- Added two-way Journal/Contract navigation without trusting the client for progression data.
+- Retained yaw and pitch for every WASD Dash direction and stationary vertical Dash requests.
+- Declared the `exploration-contract` protocol capability for Fabric and Forge.
